https://github.com/snape/RVO2-CS/blob/8e7cf2f9bdc331fe0802cdfb10d6c19fb5b20745/RVOCS/Agent.cs

OrcaAvoidance.cs and NavigationVelocitySolver.cs adapt the finite-horizon ORCA construction and linear programs.
The engine supplies sampled actual movement, typed navigation boundaries, resource-aware Jobs,
weighted pair responsibility, baked-clearance accounting and reusable workspaces.
